\[ R_S(t) = P(\text{No failure}) = P(\text{Component 1 survives}) \times P(\text{Component 2 survives}) \times P(\text{Component 3 survives}) \times P(\text{Component 4 survives}) \times P(\text{Component 5 survives)} \]  
\[ R_S(t) = R_1(t) \cdot R_2(t) \cdot R_3(t) \times R_4(t) \times R_5(t) \]  
This is the same as the serial system, but the interpretation is different.  

