This is because the system only survives if all components survive.  

**b) Parallel Structure**  
In a parallel series, the system survives if at least one component survives.  
- Let \( R_1(t) \), \( R_2(t) \), \( R_3(t) \), \( R_4(t) \), and \( R_5(t) \) be the reliability functions of the five components.  
