\[
\text{Payout ratio} = \frac{\text{Payout}}{\text{Base cost}} = \frac{60}{40} = \frac{3}{2} = 1.5
\]  
The payout ratio is $\boxed{1.5}$.
</ASSISTANT_RESPONSE>

