- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of free air, which is \( 10^{-6} \, \text{T} \cdot \text{A} / \text{A} \).
- \( N \) is the number of turns in the coil.
- \( Q \) is the current flowing through the coil.
- \( R \) is the radius of the coil.

